WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.004 --> 00:00:05.147
Track changes

2
00:00:05.656 --> 00:00:15.706
With track changes on, edits are kept as suggestions instead of changing the text straight away.

3
00:00:15.709 --> 00:00:23.123
Edits from an editor arrive this way too. Here is one.

4
00:00:23.128 --> 00:00:28.720
Deleted words are struck through, new words are underlined, and each change is listed here.

5
00:00:28.724 --> 00:00:36.677
Accept or reject each change, or all of them at once.
